The Helm charts under charts/gcp/ are ports of Cloud Foundation Fabric's
Terraform modules to Config Connector objects: their values, defaults,
validations, naming and outputs follow the modules they port, and their
descriptions quote the modules' variable descriptions. Each chart names
the module and the commit it was ported from in its Chart.yaml (sources
and the hfl.dev/source* annotations), in its README, and at the top of
each template, which also names the fabric file it ports and carries the
fabric file's copyright line. The pinned commits are in UPSTREAM.md.

The charts render Kubernetes objects for Config Connector
(https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/k8s-config-connector), Copyright
Google LLC, Apache-2.0. Its CRDs are fetched at test time by hack/kcc.sh
and are not in this repository.
